WEBVTT

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:30.851
But, as scientists,
we use behavioral terms

00:04:30.875 --> 00:04:34.143
such as strategy

00:04:34.167 --> 00:04:38.268
to describe behaviors
to certain conditions,

00:04:38.292 --> 00:04:40.393
actions and reactions

00:04:40.417 --> 00:04:45.583
that are actually programmed
into the DNA of the organism.

00:04:46.458 --> 00:04:49.226
So I started studying
these trade strategies

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:51.809
when I was 19 years old

00:04:51.833 --> 00:04:55.351
and I was living in
the tropical rainforests of Panama.

00:04:55.375 --> 00:05:01.518
Now, everybody at the time was interested
in this incredible diversity aboveground.